---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AdSenseAd from '../../components/AdSenseAd.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="專業寵物年齡計算入口 | 選擇您的專屬工具" description="深入了解您的愛犬愛貓的人類年齡對應。選擇專屬計算機，獲取基於獸醫科學的方法論與詳細照護建議。"></BaseLayout>
   <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-6">
    <header class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">選擇您的專屬寵物年齡計算機</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        我們提供基於獸醫科學研究的專業年齡換算工具。選擇您的寵物類型，深入了解其生命階段、專業照護建議與詳細計算方法論。
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
      <a href="/tools/dog-age-calculator" class="group block">
        <Card className="h-full hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500">
          <div class="text-blue-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">狗狗年齡計算機</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base">採用 AVMA 科學演算法，精準計算狗狗人類歲數，並提供生命階段照護指南。</p>
        </Card>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/cat-age-calculator" class="group block">
        <Card className="h-full hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500">
          <div class="text-blue-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">貓咪年齡計算機</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-base">精準換算貓咪人類歲數，提供生命階段照護指南，了解熟齡貓與老年貓的照護重點。</p>
        </Card>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto mt-12 text-center text-sm text-slate-500">
      <p>我們的所有計算工具皆基於最新的科學研究與權威獸醫組織（如 AVMA, AAHA）的指南開發，旨在提供您最準確可靠的資訊。</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

